sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant SUP as Supervisor (LangGraph)
    participant LLM as OpenAI
    participant GEN as Genetics agent
    participant GMCP as Genetics MCP server
    participant BLOG as Blog agent
    participant BMCP as Blog MCP server

    User->>SUP: "Research CFTR F508del, then draft a post about it"
    SUP->>LLM: history + message + tools ask_blog, ask_genetics, ...
    LLM-->>SUP: tool_call ask_genetics {task: "Look up F508del in ClinVar, what CFTR does, one recent paper"}
    SUP->>GEN: task + the user's message
    GEN->>GMCP: tools/list, then tools/call (ClinVar, NCBI Gene, PubMed)
    GMCP-->>GEN: results
    GEN-->>SUP: report (ids, findings, links)

    SUP->>LLM: messages + genetics report
    LLM-->>SUP: tool_call ask_blog {task: "Draft a post with these findings and sources: ..."}
    SUP->>BLOG: task (with the genetics findings written in) + the user's message
    BLOG->>BMCP: tools/call create_post
    BMCP-->>BLOG: {id: 12, status: draft}
    BLOG-->>SUP: report "Drafted post 12 ..."

    SUP->>LLM: messages + blog report
    LLM-->>SUP: streamed answer from both reports
    SUP-->>User: tokens, plus every delegation and tool call, over SSE
